Test rg59: start names a label in another bank
// go is defined in bank 5 only, and the program ends in bank 3, a bank first
// used before bank 5.  start go was refused, "symbol go has no defined value",
// one line past the end of the file.  The name is now looked up in every bank,
// as go:* is, and the start address carries its bank: 050300.
100/
    hlt
bank 3
200/
x, 0
bank 5
300/
go, lac x:3
    hlt
bank 3
start go
